Following the existing pattern, a likely formula is:

{"formula": "=ABS(J6)-(E6-(H6-I6))"}

However, a cleaner approach that mirrors the entry-to-stop distance is:

{"formula": "=ABS(J6-(E6-(H6-I6)))"}

I'll go with the more robust one.

{"formula": "=ABS(J6-(E6-(H6-I6)))"}

